WEBVTT

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:20.480
Sakakino Academy 10th Orientation

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.150
Itou Makoto

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:42.330
It was at the start of the second semester when I noticed that she took the same train as me.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:51.310
The train heading towards the school will be leaving shortly on Line 1.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.060
Please watch out for the closing doors.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.050
Wait!

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:13.940
All I knew about her was that she was in the class next door.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:18.480
She seemed to like books and was always reading them on the train.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:25.260
Nothing was supposed to come out of noticing that we took the same train, but...

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:31.490
...from that point, I started to get interested in her.

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:35.500
But that isn't to say that I went around trying to find out more about her,

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.270
or would even go as far as trying to talk to her.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:47.490
It was just sort of like I could look at her... Gaze at Katsura Kotonoha from afar.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:51.690
And one day, I just sort of felt like I wanted a bit more.

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:58.020
Do you know about that cell phone love urban legend?

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:01.970
Yeah, if you take a picture of the person you like and make it your background,

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:06.030
and nobody finds out about it for three weeks, things will go well between you and that person!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:38.170
So if no one finds out, then things will go well between me and her, huh?

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.900
Pretty stupid.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:47.500
1 Item - Delete

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.970
1 Item - Delete
Delete
Cancel

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.050
Hey! Whatcha looking at?

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:55.240
Ah, that urban legend, huh?

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.310
I didn't expect you to be into things like that.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.590
That's not it!

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.720
Besides this has nothing to do with you, Saionji.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.220
You're no fun.

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:04.120
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.740
I'll be sitting next to you starting today. Nice to meet you, Itou Makoto-kun!

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.150
Right.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.400
You're no fun.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.400
Not really.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.840
Hey, Itou, you look like you're pretty good at studying.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:18.910
Not really.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.250
You're no fun.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.710
Hey, Itou...

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:23.870
What?!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.120
You like Katsura in Class 4, don't you?

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.740
You saw?

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.260
I did.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:41.760
O-Iwa raked the comb through her hair,
yanking hair from the roots in great clumps.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.880
Hey, Saionji.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.480
Hey!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:41.780
We're in the middle of class.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:46.740
She clenched the comb tightly in her hand, and said "I, Iwa, am on the verge of death..."

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.790
You better not tell anyone.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:45.950
Why?

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.770
Because I say so!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.090
Is something wrong?

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.000
No...

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:59.890
"...and surely my death means that that girl shall be wed."

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.860
You're trying that urban legend, right?

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.870
I'm not!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.370
Then why?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:11.890
"Oh, how I hate thee, Iyemon! I shall bring ruin upon the house of the Kihei. Oh, how I hate thee!"

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.870
I just felt like taking a picture!

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.880
No one's gonna believe that!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.050
You're right. I wouldn't believe it either.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.880
Hahaha...

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:27.430
She tightened her grip on the comb, and Takuetsu saw blood drip from her hand and splatter the screen in front of her.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.380
She's Katsura in Class 4, right?

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.390
Stop talking about it already!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.390
You don't have to hide it. She's really cute, you know.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.880
How many days have you been following the legend for?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.400
It's the first day.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.400
Is something the matter?

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.200
Nothing! I'm sorry!

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.050
Take that!

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.740
Taisuke!

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:53.410
Don't skip class.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.030
It's pretty much over.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.480
Well, that doesn't really matter.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:00.600
What do you want?

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.820
Makoto, I didn't know...

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:02.390
Huh?

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.210
...that you were that close to Saionji.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.390
She's the one who started talking to me.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:08.430
She's totally into you.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:12.510
Saionji is pretty popular, you know!

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:16.570
Eh? I thought she was just some noisy girl.

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:19.790
You really aren't a good judge of girls, are you?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.130
Leave me alone.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.200
How nice.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.300
Saionji's cute...

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.350
What?

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.860
You like her?

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.960
I like all cute girls.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:29.850
Yeah, yeah...

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.840
Even though I'm aiming for her so much...

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.270
Makoto, you're being unfair here!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.900
What?! I haven't done anything!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.920
I don't think of her that way!

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.400
That's just what you think now.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.710
Soon, you'll leave us behind and climb the stairs to adulthood.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.380
But Saionji, eh?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:51.250
You smart ass! You've already won and I'm only the only one who isn't going to get any!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:51.720
I told you it wasn't like-!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.710
I'm going to kill you and then kill myself!

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.450
You're not making any sense!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.460
Itou.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.680
Hey, I want to talk to you about something.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:00.630
What is it?

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.360
I can't talk to you about it here.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.700
Don't mess around!

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:07.770
Idiot! You're definitely taking this the wrong way!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.750
I don't think you'll like it if I talk about it here.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.040
Congratulations!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.250
Idiot!

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.940
Why do you have the roof key, Saionji?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.990
I'm the president of the astronomy club.

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.500
Even though you're a freshman?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:26.160
It's been a dead club for years, so I volunteered for the part.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:29.870
It was a piece of cake to get permission when I told them that I wanted to do star gazing.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.520
And in reality, you aren't really doing anything of the sort.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.230
Is there any point in that?

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.170
Don't you think it's exciting?

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.500
Isn't it fun and exciting to have a secret place all to yourself?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.400
So that's why?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:46.350
Anyway, I'm pretty uncomfortable right now and I'm not having any fun.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.520
What did you want to talk about?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.270
I forget.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:50.890
You're the one who called me up here!

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.650
I know.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:54.860
You're pretty impatient.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:56.270
Okay, time for the news, then.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:03.090
Hurray! I just became friends with Katsura-san a few minutes ago.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:07.310
We have PE with Class 4, right?

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.890
And that's when I did it!

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:11.770
That's when... How?

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.810
You really wanna know, don't ya?

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:15.580
No...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:20.710
Katsura-san's not very strong, so she was sitting out.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.150
I pretended to be sick and spent some time with her.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:25.010
Pretending is bad, you know.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:30.650
Well, I was thinking of you, you know? I looked at your phone and stuff...

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:35.990
And so we talked a lot and I feel like I completely understand her now.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.440
I-Is that right?

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:42.060
It seems that Katsura gets isolated from a lot of the class because she's so cute.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.560
Really?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.370
She's not able to make a lot of friends, so she's lonely.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:51.850
I got her email address and her telephone number! Isn't that amazing?

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:52.610
It is!

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:55.260
I'm planning on trying to call her tonight.

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.360
I'll report what happens to you later.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.940
O-Okay...

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:02.370
But, Saionji, why are you doing all this for me?

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:07.040
Itou, you're pretty popular with the girls.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:07.810
I am?

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:09.880
See, you didn't even notice.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.150
What are you saying?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:17.360
I'm saying that there are people who like you, so as a girl I can't ignore this, can I?

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.780
Huh, are you mad?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:23.380
I wasn't trying to tease you.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.200
Did you tell...

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.060
Did you tell someone already?

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.590
Itou, you're being kind of scary.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.850
It's okay.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:35.560
I won't tell anyone else.

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.840
Anyone else?!

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.820
What do you mean by "anyone else?!"

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:42.120
It hurts...

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.570
I'm sorry.

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.790
I didn't tell anyone.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:49.840
Really?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.820
Yeah.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.230
Thank god...

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.980
If you understand, then move.

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.830
If someone saw us like this...

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:00.240
It'd be pretty bad.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:04.360
I-I'm sorry! I just got upset and...

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:05.840
It's okay.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.030
Itou, you're pretty serious, after all.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.530
I'll cheer you on, okay?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.370
Huh?

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:19.590
I'm not playing you. I'll help you out so that she'll like you, too.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.570
You can count on me!

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.280
I haven't even said okay yet.

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:30.340
If you don't count on me, maybe I'll tell someone about all of this.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.880
Wait, Saionji!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.030
Just call me Sekai.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:38.200
Saionji Sekai. The Sekai means "world."

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:40.270
It's a name on a pretty large scale, don't you think?

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:41.490
I like it.

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.740
It's too big.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:43.590
What?

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.210
But, I guess it's kind of cool.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:46.670
Isn't it?!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:52.510
I'm kind of not cool.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:54.540
That's not true.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.990
Yeah... I'm sorry for getting mad.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.000
Well, good luck, Makoto.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.610
So you're going to call me by my first name, too?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:01.640
Who cares?

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.730
There we go.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:13.750
Sekai.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.000
Setsuna?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.570
You were waiting?

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.480
What did you talk to Itou about?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.050
You knew about that?

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:25.240
Oh, nothing really. Itou's pretty interesting so I sort of became friends with him.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.720
Okay, where are we going today?

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:31.480
There's a new kind of bean-jam dumpling at the shop.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.980
Alright, sounds great!

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:42.190
Why did it turn out this way...

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:45.080
Hello?

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.380
Hey, Makoto?!

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:48.860
Are you going at it?! Are you going at it right now-?!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:02.410
And so I believe the reason for giving me the death penalty was...

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.060
...that I never shut up about the monkey during trial.

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:06.030
Notes concerning the girl in question.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:10.650
But the reason given on paper was that it was possible that I was a master Japanese spy,

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.230
She likes to read.

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.700
I already know that!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.730
She always eats lunch at the cafeteria. Her favorite is the chicken ramen. But sometimes she'll have the spaghetti.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:16.600
and while I working to restore the Qing Dynasty, I had been in contact with the Japanese, betraying the nation of China.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.200
She likes noodles?

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.400
Her boobs are really big.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.200
I know that.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.110
Pervert.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.370
And I have an important announcement

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.760
To which I said "Thank you, I had no idea I was such an important person."

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.240
What?

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:27.280
I told Katsura that the three of us should have lunch today. Have fun!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:29.870
Is something the matter?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.710
It's nothing, sir!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.700
This is terrible!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.050
I can't do this! I can't do this at all!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.170
It's fine. Just come with me!

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:42.220
How did it go this far between yesterday and today?!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.690
I talked to her last night on the phone and that's how!

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:46.320
And I'm asking you how!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:48.300
Does there even need to be a reason to ask her to eat with us?

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.070
There does!

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:50.750
I'm not emotionally prepared for this!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.140
What are you saying?!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.580
Just thinking about it is making my legs shake!

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:55.960
You're a man, right?!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.460
I don't have to be!

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.350
Yes, you do!

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:00.720
I've already given up.

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.110
What are you saying?

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.690
Oh, yeah, I haven't done my physics report yet.

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.470
Just forget about it!

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.880
But...

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:14.990
Oh, that's right. Katsura told me who she likes.

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:16.720
If you want to know, come with me!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:22.680
Katsura said she doesn't really have a boyfriend or anything.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:23.450
Seriously?

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.830
It's true!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:29.210
There's someone she's sort of interested in, but it's not as if she really likes them.

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:30.670
So there's someone she's interested in...

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:32.310
Don't get so depressed at everything I say!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:36.310
So if you really try, you have a chance!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:38.480
I guess I'm content just learning about that.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:40.010
You idiot!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.160
You can't get what you want just by wishing for it!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.630
Save me!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.430
U-Um...

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:57.440
Katsura-san...

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.300
Sorry for making you wait.

00:12:58.300 --> 00:12:59.940
Saionji-san.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.210
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.930
No, I just got here.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:07.450
Hey.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.920
H-Hi.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.690
Hi...

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:13.680
Nice to meet you. My name is Katsura Kotonoha.

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.420
I'm Itou Makoto...

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.860
What is this? A blind date?

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.390
Anyway, don't be so formal.

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:21.660
Let's have lunch.

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:22.410
Yeah.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:23.410
Y-Yeah.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:27.440
Katsura-san, that looks good!

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:30.920
I'm not really that good, but please have some.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.710
Wow, so you made that yourself?

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:38.060
Yes. I was invited after all, so I thought I should at least do something.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.920
You didn't have to go that far.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.500
Here, Makoto. Katsura-san made these.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.950
Oh, okay!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:46.990
Itou-kun, have some if you'd like.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.250
I'd love to!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.200
Time for a bite!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:56.090
How are they?

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:59.270
Well, they're not bad.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:13:59.950
Right?

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:02.320
Y-Yeah...

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:06.070
It definitely tastes like nothing else I've had before.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.440
Katsura-san, your cooking...

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.860
Yes, this was pretty much my first time cooking.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:11.970
Oh...

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.780
Does it taste bad?

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:15.830
What are you saying?!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.480
I'd never had anything like it before, so my tongue was just surprised.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.450
I can do this!

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.210
That's right! Go!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.710
It's good! The mustard burns!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:28.390
She seemed to like it!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:29.220
It might be okay!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.600
I have some hot tea, as well, so you don't have to rush too much.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.720
Wow, you thought of everything.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.580
Here you go, Itou-kun.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:40.960
Makoto!

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.080
Itou-kun!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.600
I tried to eat too much too quickly.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.320
That's because you don't know when to hold back.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.800
Are you okay?

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.120
Katsura-san!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.400
I just...

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:57.620
Um...

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.420
Well, then...

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:00.960
Where are you going?

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.470
Sorry, just going to the restroom for a bit.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.670
Itou-kun!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:14.170
Bag her, Makoto.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.610
Um...

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:23.660
Itou-kun, you're more of a comedian than I thought.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.680
Did you think I was someone scary?

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:29.170
I thought you were more laid back.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:33.200
Well, normally I am! It's just that today's special!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.620
It is?

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.280
Yes. Because I'm eating lunch with you...

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:42.490
I mean not just you and me alone! Sekai, too!

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:46.200
It'd be the three of us and it'd be special and-!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.190
Sekai's been in there pretty long.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.050
Wait a second.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.050
That means you already knew about me?

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:59.210
Oh, no! You just seemed different from what Saionji told me.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:00.880
O-Oh, that's it.

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:06.480
That makes sense. Damn it.

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:11.310
But, Katsura-san's pretty cute.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.000
No, really.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.450
I'm really grateful, Sekai.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.460
Really?

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.890
Really!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:24.170
It's awesome that I'm able to talk to Katsura-san this much!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.090
That's normal.

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.000
You're just too shy.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.710
Anyway, thanks.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.760
Stop it already. We're in the same class, anyway.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:37.590
Well, I guess for me it's not so much fun anymore since it's going so well.

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:39.340
You're sure mean.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:43.460
But, if you didn't help me out, this would have been impossible.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.990
Makoto...

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:49.680
Sekai, I'm planning on asking Katsura-san tomorrow.

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:55.030
She might say no, but I want to tell her how I feel about her right now.

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:58.160
That's manly of you, Makoto.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.040
Sekai?

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:01.820
I'm sure you can pull it off.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:02.940
Thank you.

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.010
Go for it!

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.050
Okay.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:10.090
Okay, I'm going for it all!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.690
Alright, go for it.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:27.450
The train heading to the school will be arriving shortly. Please stand behind the white line.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:28.700
Katsura-san!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.310
Itou-kun.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.840
Good morning.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.200
Good morning.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:37.160
You take the same train, right?

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.080
Yeah.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.230
Itou-kun?

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.820
U-Um...

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.470
Get ready...

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:46.470
Go!

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.110
Yo.

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:49.410
Saionji-san.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:51.500
I'm not feeling that well either.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.330
Um, Saionji-san?

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:01.040
Wh-What is it?

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:05.160
Itou-kun...asked me out.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:09.020
He sure moves fast.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:12.330
I said yes...

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.580
Oh, that's great!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.500
What's wrong?

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.500
Do you remember me saying that there was someone I was interested in?

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.470
I do.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:28.550
But, if you remember someone like that while you're dating Makoto...

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:31.040
Makoto's delicate, so he'll get depressed.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:36.410
The person I was interested in...was Itou-kun.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:42.770
It felt like there was someone always watching me on the train.

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:49.150
I just brushed it off as being overly self-conscious,
but once I started thinking about it, I got more curious.

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.740
And that person was Itou-kun.

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.040
That's...

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.020
Then both of you like each other.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:19:01.510
Yeah. I was so happy when Itou-kun asked me out this morning.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:02.620
Yeah.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:06.530
I want to thank you.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:09.920
You're the one that brought us together.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:15.220
If you didn't do that, there wouldn't really have been a chance for me to get to know him.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:19.030
You can't show how you feel just by wanting something to happen.

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:21.770
I told Makoto the same thing.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:26.580
It was because he was saying things like he was just happy to be watching you.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.770
That's...

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:34.350
Makoto's a really nice guy and he really likes you.

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:37.290
Go for it.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.280
Thank you!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:48.160
You wouldn't say something like that at school.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.290
Sekai...

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:54.020
It's okay. Everyone's can hear what's going on at school, so something like that is hard to say.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:56.540
So you're waiting for Katsura-san?

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.690
Yeah.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:20:00.190
Katsura-san said that she has a student council meeting, so she'll be late.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:01.440
Yeah, I know.

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.650
Don't be impatient and try to get in her pants.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:04.860
I wouldn't do that.

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:06.100
Well, that's good.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.880
I don't need a chaperon.

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:10.790
Dummy, I take this line, too.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.680
Really? I haven't seen you on the train at all.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.490
I go the other way.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.820
I get off at Moteharasakashita.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.000
Really?

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.460
I told you that, you know.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.900
Sorry...

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:23.700
It's okay.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.910
Hey, Sekai...

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.370
Why are you doing so much for me?

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.410
You wouldn't normally do this much for someone just because you looked at their cell phone.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.710
It's fun.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:34.700
That's it?

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.690
What else would there be?

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.800
There isn't anything more fun than watching someone else in love.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.220
So that's what it was?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:46.060
Entertainment news and TV dramas are almost always about love, right?

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:47.190
Yeah...

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.930
And to control the worlds of two people-

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.510
Oh, I don't mean my name. I mean their worlds.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:53.780
I know that.

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:56.360
And to make their worlds converge and move with my own hands...

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:59.540
I feel like I sort of get what you're saying and I sort of don't...

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:02.810
Well, that's what makes it fun.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:05.380
It feels like I owe you a lot.

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:11.260
You do. So big you won't be able to pay it back your whole life.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:13.940
Just kidding.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.950
But, I'll definitely pay you back.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:16.830
Really?

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:18.430
You don't have to break your back over it.

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:20.270
Even if I have to break my back, I'll pay you back.

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:24.190
Hm, then what should I ask for...

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.770
I'll do anything!

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:27.120
Well then...

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:29.300
Take your time and think about it.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.170
See? The train's already here anyway.

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:32.150
Just ask me-

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:47.210
That's good enough.

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.640
Sekai...

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.920
Good luck with your date!

00:24:49.350 --> 00:24:53.050
Next Time
The Distance Between Them
